## Remaining limitations

The 320×568 expanded-panel and arrival states were screenshot-reviewed. Other requested viewport sizes were checked with browser DOM measurements, not individual screenshots. Device-specific iOS and Android safe-area behavior was not tested on physical devices; the preview’s safe-area value resolves in its desktop browser environment.
