390×844 and 1440×900 after-screenshots are **NOT VERIFIED**. The preview screenshot tool reported that the page had not been drawn because its window was minimized or covered. I did not reload or repeatedly retry it.

## E. Forward and backward playback

**PARTIAL.** In the live preview, I planned Campus Gate → ICT LAB, entered CEIT, followed the route through its Ground Floor stair handoffs to Floors 2, 3, and 4, and reached Arrival. The Floor indicator and context-aware Continue action were visible at the handoffs.

Earlier shared QA also recorded CABA-201 → CABA building reaching its Ground Floor exit handoff; a Previous action returned to the walking instruction. Intermediate movement samples for that route were inconclusive.

The automated `walkingAnimation`, `studentRouteFlow`, and `routePlanner` checks passed. I did not live-sample three intermediate positions for each forward and reverse seek across the requested route matrix. Reverse route variants, Canteen routes, 1×/2× motion, and live 3D Follow/Explore tracking therefore remain **NOT VERIFIED** in this pass. No new playback defect was confirmed, so I made no pathfinding, playback, floor-transition, or camera changes.

## F. Tests and build

- **PASS:** Focused Student navigation UI tests, 96/96. This subset is included in the combined count.
- **PASS:** Combined five-file navigation regression run, 291/291.
- **PASS:** Additional camera pose, 3D presentation, mobile panel, and transition-marker tests, 51/51.
- **PASS:** 342 tests across nine files, 0 failed and 0 skipped.
- **PASS:** Production build; Vite reported its existing large-chunk warning.
- **PARTIAL:** TypeScript diagnostic comparison found 512 existing diagnostic identities in both snapshots, with 0 added and 0 removed. `tsc` still exits with the existing errors.
- **PASS:** `git diff --check`.

## G. Files and worktree

The UI correction changed [UnifiedRoutePlannerDialog.tsx](src/components/map/UnifiedRoutePlannerDialog.tsx) and [RoutePlannerStudentUx.test.tsx](src/components/map/__tests__/RoutePlannerStudentUx.test.tsx). The screenshots linked above, plus route-preview and floor-progress captures, were saved under [verification-artifacts](verification-artifacts).

The worktree was already modified across other navigation and map files. Those shared changes were preserved. No changes were staged, and nothing was committed, pushed, merged, or deployed.

## H. Remaining limitations

The 320×568 visual correction is **PASS**. Responsive DOM measurements are **PASS** for the tested viewport matrix. Visual review at 390×844, desktop, and Light theme is **NOT VERIFIED**. Full live bidirectional motion sampling and live 3D Follow/Explore verification are **NOT VERIFIED**; the overall objective remains **PARTIAL**.
