## F. Navigation behavior

Route selection and activation reuse the existing navigation lifecycle. The sheet gesture is kept in the panel presentation state; it does not initiate route calculation or navigation. Playback, Follow/Explore, route editing, and floor-transition behavior remain on their existing paths.

