Implemented the focused Edit Route alignment correction.

### What changed

The pencil was a separate flex item, so it could drift between the destination and Follow/Explore. It now sits inside the destination’s edit control in both the expanded planner panel and compact map card. The text truncates while the pencil stays visible, and the full destination remains available through the accessible name and tooltip.

The control reuses the existing edit handlers, has hover, active, and focus styling, and keeps the 44px mobile touch target within the existing row. Follow/Explore, playback controls, and emergency edit restrictions remain in place.

