## Explore Route update

The expanded panel’s excess space came from stacking both endpoint names inside a mobile sheet that kept a tall fixed height. Explore now shows **From** as the only endpoint summary in compact and expanded modes. A map-pin accent marks the starting point, and the name and pencil form one group. The destination remains in the route steps and on the map.

The name opens the existing full-name popover. It sizes to its text for short names and stays viewport-bounded for long names. The pencil still invokes the existing route-edit handler and respects its current availability rules.

Expanded mobile Explore now sizes to its content within the existing height limit. Follow/Explore stays right-aligned at narrow widths. No route, camera, or editing logic was changed.

