- **PASS:** `git diff --check`. Git emitted only its existing LF-to-CRLF warning for `CampusMapPage.tsx`.
- **PARTIAL:** Guest browser preview — switched from the outdoor 2D map to 3D, entered CABA Ground Floor, and checked the 390×844 layout. The Back to campus control and viewing-angle control were present with 44px targets; the map had no horizontal overflow. The active indoor WebGL context reported healthy after entry and after the angle-control interaction.

## Limits and worktree

No frame-rate or FPS improvement is claimed: this pass did not collect reliable performance profiles. The preview could not verify physical touch gestures, haptics, or camera permissions. One `THREE.WebGLRenderer: Context Lost.` log appeared during the outdoor-to-indoor renderer transition; the replacement indoor canvas remained active and reported `isContextLost() === false`. This does not establish whether the outgoing-context message is expected disposal or a preview-specific issue.

